@startuml
' Vista Fisica / Despliegue — Topologia de red y nodos
title Vista Fisica: Despliegue del Sistema PQRS

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FA
  BorderColor #2B2D42
}

cloud "Internet" as Internet {
  actor Cliente
  actor Gestor
}

node "Balanceador de Carga\n(Nginx / HAProxy)" as LB {
  artifact "TCP 443 HTTPS"
}

node "Cluster Servidores App\n(Spring Boot — 2+ instancias)" as AppCluster {
  artifact "TCP 8080 (interno)"
  artifact "JWT validation"
  artifact "BCrypt hash"
}

node "Servidor Web Estatico\n(Nginx, sirve Angular build)" as WebStatic {
  artifact "TCP 80/443"
}

database "PostgreSQL\nPrimario" as DBMaster {
  artifact "TCP 5432"
}

database "PostgreSQL\nReplica (standby)" as DBReplica {
  artifact "TCP 5432\nreplicacion async"
}

folder "NAS / FileSystem\n(adjuntos PDF)" as NAS {
  artifact "NFS TCP 2049"
}

node "SMTP Gateway\n(Postfix / SES)" as SMTP {
  artifact "SMTP TCP 587 (TLS)"
}

Cliente --> LB : HTTPS\n(App Mobile, App Web)
Gestor --> LB : HTTPS

LB --> WebStatic : sirve bundle\nAngular/Ionic
LB --> AppCluster : reverse proxy\n/api/*

AppCluster --> DBMaster : JDBC SSL
DBMaster --> DBReplica : replicacion\nasincrona
AppCluster --> NAS : NFS lectura/escritura
AppCluster --> SMTP : envio asincrono\nde correo

note right of LB
  HTTPS obligatorio.
  Sin entrada TCP 80
  (redirige a 443).
end note

note right of AppCluster
  Sin estado en memoria
  (sesion via JWT).
  Escalable horizontal.
end note

note bottom of DBReplica
  Failover manual a replica
  en caso de caida del primario.
  Backup diario via pg_dump
  sin afectar produccion.
end note

@enduml
